- Capteurs et Instrumentation Industriels (Industrial Sensors and Instrumentation)
- Électronique de puissance (Power Electronics)
- Automates Programmable industriel 1 (Industrial Programmable Automation 1)
- Management de l'innovation (Innovation Management)
- English for Automation and Control

Message to analyze:
"" + ($json.body.message_text || "").replace(/"/g, '\"') + ""

Determine if this message announces a rescheduled class, a time change, an exam/homework date, or a new Google Meet link for a course.
Return ONLY valid JSON (no markdown formatting, no backticks):
{
  "is_schedule_update": true or false,
  "subject": "One of the known module names or unknown",
  "day_of_week": "Monday/Tuesday/Wednesday/Thursday/Friday/Saturday/Sunday or null",
  "time": "HH:MM or null",
  "meet_url": "https://meet.google.com/... or null",
  "notes": "short summary in French/English"
}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
} }}

parameters.jsCode:
for (let item of $input.all()) {
  let raw = item.json.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || "{}";
  raw = raw.replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();
  try {
    item.json = JSON.parse(raw);
  } catch(e) {
    item.json = { is_schedule_update: false, error: e.message, raw: raw };
  }
}
return $input.all();

